### GET /hello — happy path: 200 OK with JSON greeting
GET http://localhost:8080/hello
Accept: application/json

###

### POST /hello — expect 405 Method Not Allowed
POST http://localhost:8080/hello
Content-Type: application/json

###

### PUT /hello — expect 405 Method Not Allowed
PUT http://localhost:8080/hello
Content-Type: application/json

###

### DELETE /hello — expect 405 Method Not Allowed
DELETE http://localhost:8080/hello

###
